Yes! Thank you, Honourable Member. The total time allocated for debating this bill is 4 hours. That is: PNC 2 hours and 35 minutes; MDP 33 minutes; MDA 14 minutes; Jumhooree Party 12 minutes;

MNP 12 minutes; and 7 minutes for each Honourable Member not affiliated with any party. I open the floor for Honourable Members to request to speak. Yes! There are now only a few seconds left before today's break. So, what I intend, yes! It is now 10:30. So what I intend next is that we come back to work and continue with the debate on the bill. So, at this point I adjourn the Majlis for the 30-minute break. Thank you.

{Break: 10:30 to 11:00} (Presiding: Speaker of the Majlis Abdul Raheem Abdulla)
